---
title: "Make a daily database backup"
sidebar:
  order: 2
---

Create a restorable copy of the database and, when selected, managed files and media.

## Steps

{% steps %}

1. Open the home or project drawer and select `Backup database`.
2. Choose whether to include project data, managed files, and media in the archive.
3. Use a descriptive filename containing the date and device or team name.
4. Save the backup to storage separate from the working device.
5. Confirm that the resulting file exists and can be opened by the intended restore workflow.
{% /steps %}

{% aside type="caution" %}

A CSV export or light project transfer is not a restorable database backup.

{% /aside %}

